  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start the process, Course Packet Information Received should be sent"
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause implicitly initializes the process (init) and explicitly defines the first actionable step (send Course Packet Information Received)."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "followed by sending the Design to Faculty. After sending the Design to Faculty, the Faculty will choose the design."
      ],
      "justification": "Both action nodes faithfully reproduce the two sequential steps described in the segment."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, identify the content that requires copyright clearance and contact the publisher to obtain clearance."
      ],
      "justification": "The segment describes two distinct tasks joined by 'and', accurately captured by the two consecutive action nodes."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Action content exactly reproduces the quoted instructional text from the source."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued.",
        "However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "The conditional clauses in both segments implicitly define the exclusive split point represented by the branch node."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly matches the positive-arm action specified in the source."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After calculating the Course Packet Cost, the MPC should add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price."
      ],
      "justification": "Faithfully restates the calculation step with identical operands and purpose."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued.",
        "Alternatively, if the Price of the Course Packet is finalized, then the MPC should notify the Bookstore of the Course packet, Course number, Faculty name, and sections."
      ],
      "justification": "The mutually exclusive conditions in these segments define the second decision split."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "end:e1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the MPC notifies the Bookstore, the Packet information should be notified to the Bookstore, and the process will end."
      ],
      "justification": "The closing phrase explicitly signals process termination, supporting the structural end node."
    }
